  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy auditing and capacity building on energy management for five rice mills in the Senegal River Valley</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support  greening  the rice industry in Senegal River Valley by catalyzing energy saving and mitigation measures through the generation and dissemination of knowledge on economically viable investments in five selected Senegalese rice mills that save energy, mitigate greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions   and increase the productivity of rice mills. The project will conduct energy audits and develop action plans for the introduction of RE solutions and EE management plans in 5 rice mills in the Senegal river valley. The activities in this project will be implemented from November 2020 to June 2023</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support  greening  the rice industry in Senegal River Valley by catalyzing energy saving and mitigation measures through the generation and dissemination of knowledge on economically viable investments in five selected Senegalese rice mills that save energy, mitigate greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions   and increase the productivity of rice mills. The project will conduct energy audits and develop action plans for the introduction of RE solutions and EE management plans in 5 rice mills in the Senegal river valley. The activities in this project will be implemented from November 2020 to June 2023</narrative>
  </description>
